      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIVOT (2) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 1.75 lengths at Warrnambool in a handy 21.89 beating Lektra Jimmy. Fair draw can see a good run and goes well over this trip. Has won two of four starts from this draw. Looks to have an edge on most of these. MISS JO (8) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on her excellent win three back, getting around this track over 400m in 22.52. Should be in this for a long way. FOXY ROXY (1) drifted back settling but did best work late to finish 5th at Bendigo over 425m (24.25). Cannot be taken lightly. PAW BALLISTA (4) is likely to have admirers.",
